---@class customerio.CreateWebhookRequest
---@field endpoint string The webhook URL.
---@field events customerio.CreateWebhookRequestEventsList Specifies the types of events you want to report to your webhook. See our [reporting webhooks reference](/integrations/api/webhooks/) for more information about event types and the information they return.
---@field name string The name of your webhook.
---@field disabled? boolean Set to `true` to quit sending events to the webhook URL. Set to `false` to enable the webhook.
