---@field start? string The token for the page of results you want to return. Responses contain a `next` property. Use this property as the `start` value to return the next page of results.
---@field limit? number The maximum number of results you want to retrieve per page.
---@field type? customerio.GetPersonActivitiesRequestType|string The type of activity you want to search for. Types with `_o:<object_type_id>` are for objects and types with `_r:<object_type_id>` are for relationships.
---@field name? string For `event` and `attribute_update` types, you can search by event or attribute name respectively. For the `consent` type, you can search by consent action, like `opted_in` or `opted_out`.

---@alias customerio.GetPersonActivitiesRequestIdType "id"|"email"|"phone"|"cio_id"

