---@field response? string What the person sent back, like the body of an SMS reply.
---@field sender_id? number The sender identity the consent applies to, if any.
---@field source_event_id? string The ID of the activity that produced this record, like the inbound SMS that contained STOP.
---@field topic_id? number The subscription topic the consent applies to, if any.
---@field topic_name? string The topic's name when the change happened. Renaming the topic later doesn't change this value.

---Where the change came from, like your subscription center or an SMS reply. The `subscription_preference_migration` and `sender_optout_migration` values mark records that Customer.io imported from preferences and opt-outs that existed before your account recorded consent.
