---@field content_id number The identifier of a message in a one-time send. If your one-time send has an A/B test group or includes multiple languages, each variant has its own `content_id`, separate from the `newsletter_id`. Use [List variants of a one-time send](/integrations/api/app/tag/newsletter-variants/listNewsletterVariants/) to find the `content_id` associated with the right variant.
---@field period? customerio.GetVariantLinksRequestPeriod|string The unit of time for your report.
---@field steps? number The number of periods you want to return. Defaults to the maximum available, or `12` if the period is in `months`. Maximums are 24 hours, 45 days, 12 weeks, or 121 months. Days start at 00:00 EST. Weeks start at 00:00 EST on Sunday. Months start at 00:00 EST on the 1st of the month.
---@field type? customerio.GetVariantLinksRequestType|string The type of item you want to return metrics for. When empty, the response contains metrics for all possible types.

---@alias customerio.GetVariantLinksRequestPeriod "hours"|"days"|"weeks"|"months"

---@alias customerio.GetVariantLinksRequestType "email"|"webhook"|"twilio"|"push"|"in_app"|"inbox"

