---@field machine_clicked? customerio.GetVariantLinksResponseLinksItemMetricSeriesMachineClickedList An array of machine click counts (clicks attributed to bots or prefetching) from oldest to newest, where each result indicates a period. This metric is reliable starting April 20, 2025. [Learn more](/messaging/metrics/analytics/#delivery-metrics).

