---Metrics grouped by the requested resolution. Each property is an array where each entry represents one period, such as one day.
---@class customerio.GetVariantMetricsResponseMetricSeries
---@field attempted? customerio.GetVariantMetricsResponseMetricSeriesAttemptedList The number of `attempted` messages.
---@field bounced? customerio.GetVariantMetricsResponseMetricSeriesBouncedList The number of `bounced` messages.
---@field clicked? customerio.GetVariantMetricsResponseMetricSeriesClickedList The number of `clicked` messages.
---@field converted? customerio.GetVariantMetricsResponseMetricSeriesConvertedList The number of `converted` messages.
---@field created? customerio.GetVariantMetricsResponseMetricSeriesCreatedList The number of `created` messages.
---@field deferred? customerio.GetVariantMetricsResponseMetricSeriesDeferredList The number of `deferred` messages.
---@field delivered? customerio.GetVariantMetricsResponseMetricSeriesDeliveredList The number of `delivered` messages.
---@field drafted? customerio.GetVariantMetricsResponseMetricSeriesDraftedList The number of `drafted` messages.
---@field failed? customerio.GetVariantMetricsResponseMetricSeriesFailedList The number of `failed` messages.
---@field human_clicked? customerio.GetVariantMetricsResponseMetricSeriesHumanClickedList The number of `clicked` emails excluding machine clicks. This metric is reliable starting April 20, 2025. [Learn more](/messaging/metrics/analytics/#delivery-metrics).
---@field human_opened? customerio.GetVariantMetricsResponseMetricSeriesHumanOpenedList The number of `opened` emails excluding machine opens. This metric is reliable starting March 20, 2025. [Learn more](/messaging/metrics/analytics/#delivery-metrics).
---@field link_untracked? customerio.GetVariantMetricsResponseMetricSeriesLinkUntrackedList The number of emails delivered with link tracking inactive for any reason. We subtract these from the click-rate denominator.
---@field machine_clicked? customerio.GetVariantMetricsResponseMetricSeriesMachineClickedList The number of `clicked` emails attributed to machines—security scanners, bot user agents, known proxy services, and repetitive click patterns. This metric is reliable starting April 20, 2025. [Learn more](/messaging/metrics/analytics/#delivery-metrics).
---@field open_untracked? customerio.GetVariantMetricsResponseMetricSeriesOpenUntrackedList The number of emails delivered with open tracking inactive for any reason—including the consent opt-outs that `untracked` counts and messages sent with open tracking disabled. We subtract these from the open-rate denominator.
---@field opened? customerio.GetVariantMetricsResponseMetricSeriesOpenedList The number of `opened` messages.
---@field prefetch_opened? customerio.GetVariantMetricsResponseMetricSeriesPrefetchOpenedList The number of `opened` emails attributed to machines. This metric is reliable starting March 20, 2025.
---@field replied? customerio.GetVariantMetricsResponseMetricSeriesRepliedList The number of SMS/MMS messages a person replied to with a keyword. [Learn more about inbound messages](/messaging/channels/sms/inbound/get-started/).
---@field sent? customerio.GetVariantMetricsResponseMetricSeriesSentList The number of sent messages.
---@field spammed? customerio.GetVariantMetricsResponseMetricSeriesSpammedList The number of spam complaints.
---@field suppressed? customerio.GetVariantMetricsResponseMetricSeriesSuppressedList The number of `suppressed` messages.
---@field topic_unsubscribed? customerio.GetVariantMetricsResponseMetricSeriesTopicUnsubscribedList The number of topic unsubscribes in a given period.
---@field tracking_consent_denied? customerio.GetVariantMetricsResponseMetricSeriesTrackingConsentDeniedList The number of people who denied consent to email open tracking in the period.
---@field tracking_consent_granted? customerio.GetVariantMetricsResponseMetricSeriesTrackingConsentGrantedList The number of people who granted consent to email open tracking in the period.
---@field undeliverable? customerio.GetVariantMetricsResponseMetricSeriesUndeliverableList The number of `undeliverable` messages.
---@field unsubscribed? customerio.GetVariantMetricsResponseMetricSeriesUnsubscribedList The number of unsubscribes attributed to the automation or message.
---@field untracked? customerio.GetVariantMetricsResponseMetricSeriesUntrackedList The number of `sent` emails whose open pixel we withheld because the person opted out of open tracking. We exclude these from the open-rate denominator; click tracking is unaffected.

