---@field type customerio.ImportRequestImportCase0Type|string The type of import.
---@field data_to_process? customerio.ImportRequestImportCase0DataToProcess|string Controls whether your import adds and updates all rows, adds only new rows, or updates only existing rows. Defaults to `all`. Event imports support only `all` and `only_existing`. Formerly called `people_to_process`.
---@field description? string A helpful description that can help you find and recognize your import operation.

