---@field rows_to_import? number The total number of importable rows we found in the CSV.
---@field state? customerio.ImportResponseImportState The state of the import—whether your import is waiting to start (`start`), being processed, fully completed (`imported`), or if it failed.
---@field type? customerio.ImportResponseImportType The type of import.
---@field updated_at? number The date time when the referenced ID was last updated.

