---@alias customerio.UpdateBroadcastActionLanguageRequestBody customerio.UpdateBroadcastActionLanguageRequestBodyCase0|customerio.UpdateBroadcastActionLanguageRequestBodyCase1|customerio.UpdateBroadcastActionLanguageRequestBodyCase2|customerio.UpdateBroadcastActionLanguageRequestBodyCase3

