---@field name? string The name of the collection. This is how you'll reference your collection in messages—`{{collection_name.data-property}}`.
---@field url? string The URL for your CSV or JSON data. Customer.io detects the format from the `Content-Type` that your URL returns, or from the file extension if the `Content-Type` doesn't say. JSON data can be an array of objects or one object per line. CSV data needs a header row, and Customer.io reads every CSV value as a string.

