---@class customerio.UpdateLiveNotificationRequestContentStateCase2
---@field title string Primary status line.
---@field endTime? number Countdown target, in whole seconds since 1970 UTC. A time in the future renders a live countdown; omit it to render no timer. The countdown does not clear itself when it reaches zero — it rests at \"0:00\" until you send an update with a finished title and no endTime.
---@field statusMessage? string Secondary line under the title.

